{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 15, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "患", "id": "患"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "紾", "id": "紾"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "輕", "id": "輕"}, {"form": "迎", "id": "迎"}, {"form": "重", "id": "重"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.7376696182833684, "source": "生", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 4.02535169073515, "source": "生", "target": "患"}, {"weight": 4.430816798843313, "source": "生", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "患", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 3.332204510175204, "source": "患", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "死", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "死", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 3.332204510175204, "source": "死", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "後", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "取", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "取", "target": "輕"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "取", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "取", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "取", "target": "色"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "就", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "色", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.9267394020670396, "source": "色", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "色", "target": "輕"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "食", "ta